WEBVTT

NOTE placeholder captions for V1 from the storyboard narration (temp)

V1-1-1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:17.724
Measure whether the goals were met, do not only act.

V1-1-2
00:00:17.724 --> 00:00:22.414
Activity is not evidence.

V1-1-3
00:00:22.414 --> 00:00:40.000
If you cannot name the number that proves a goal happened, it was an aspiration.

V1-2-1
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:52.143
Measurement starts tactical and intuitive, then matures into precise insight.

V1-2-2
00:00:52.143 --> 00:00:58.214
Nobody's first dashboard is right.

V1-2-3
00:00:58.214 --> 00:01:14.000
Start measuring badly rather than not at all, and sharpen it every month.

V1-3-1
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:30.414
Understand what works, what does not, which campaign failed, and which investment was profitable.

V1-3-2
00:01:30.414 --> 00:01:37.448
All four, not just the first.

V1-3-3
00:01:37.448 --> 00:01:48.000
A plan that only reports successes cannot be optimised.

V1-4-1
00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:03.167
Building the measurement infrastructure is a necessary step before any marketing activity begins.

V1-4-2
00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:10.167
Set it up before the campaign.

V1-4-3
00:02:10.167 --> 00:02:24.167
Data you do not collect today cannot be analysed in the future.

V1-4-4
00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:30.000
Nobody sets up tracking retroactively.
